usage: phase1_pick [-h] --config CONFIG [--already-docked]
                   [--base-drive-isolated] [--input-topic INPUT_TOPIC]
                   [--input-durable] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                   {green_apple,peach,tomato,fanta_can,cup,banana}

Already-docked, physically isolated base trial; wrist inputs always real.

positional arguments:
  {green_apple,peach,tomato,fanta_can,cup,banana}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --already-docked
  --base-drive-isolated
  --input-topic INPUT_TOPIC
  --input-durable       Use for the supplied Head/fusion adapter (retains six
                        targets)
  --timeout TIMEOUT
